NC Digital creates professional logos and brand identities for businesses across the Rhondda Valley. Whether you're based in Tonypandy, Treorchy, Porth, or anywhere across the Rhondda Fach and Fawr, we design logos that give your business a professional, consistent presence.

## Building a strong brand in the Rhondda

Local businesses in the Rhondda are increasingly competing online as well as on the high street. A professional logo helps you stand out — whether someone finds you on Google, sees your van, or lands on your website. It tells potential customers you take your business seriously.

We work with tradespeople, service businesses, and local companies across the Rhondda, giving them a visual identity that reflects the quality of their work.

## What's included

- 5 initial logo concepts
- Revisions until you're completely happy
- Brand colour palette and typography
- Brand guidelines document
- All file formats: PNG, SVG, PDF, JPEG

Full details on our [logo design service](/services/logo-design/).

## No AI. Designed by hand.

Every logo is created in Adobe Illustrator — no AI tools, no stock templates. Original, unique, and built to scale.

